## Reviewer points not applied
- The first-instance TWD 1.57M judgment is a published bio fact, not a promise of a result to the reader. Deleting it conflicts with R3 and with the pinned string.
- France’s narrow no-break space for thousands is right for print French. This locale’s checker only accepts dot grouping, so the dot stays.
- "1er" is right for the first of the month. The checker cannot parse it next to a month name, so the bare "1" stays.
- "née" next to "décision" leaves the masculine "acte" without agreement. "établis" covers both nouns.
- Calling the withholding-rate link "article 3" matches flno=3 and mismatches the Korean label 제10조, which the checker counts. The statute name is corrected; the visible number stays 10.
